# Copy to deploy/.env.production and fill in. Read by `docker compose --env-file` only, to fill in
# deploy/docker-compose.production.yml; never passed to the API container whole. Never committed
# (.gitignore excludes .env.*). Real values belong in that file or the host's secret settings, never
# in a chat, an issue or a commit.
# Generate each password with `openssl rand -hex 32`: hex only, so it needs no escaping inside the
# database URLs the compose file builds.
POSTGRES_SUPERUSER_PASSWORD=
CODECOACH_OWNER_PASSWORD=
CODECOACH_APP_PASSWORD=
# The https address the browser uses to reach the API (baked into the web build).
PUBLIC_API_URL=
# Optional: the proxies whose X-Forwarded-For the API trusts. The default (private ranges) covers
# Docker's gateway, which is where a proxy on this host connects from.
# FORWARDED_ALLOW_IPS=172.18.0.1
